{"seq":3,"slug":"art-and-spontaneity","title":"Art And Spontaneity","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/ideas-and-methods/art-and-spontaneity","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"scholar-painting","title":"文人画的精神","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/ideas-and-methods/art-and-spontaneity/scholar-painting","wordCount":1762,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"naturalness-in-art","title":"自然天成的艺术观","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/ideas-and-methods/art-and-spontaneity/naturalness-in-art","wordCount":1607,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<p>本章呈现苏轼的艺术精神。在绘画上，苏轼是文人画的重要倡导者，主张&quot;重神轻形&quot;&quot;以画寄意&quot;&quot;诗画一律&quot;，深刻地塑造了中国绘画的审美方向。在艺术观上，他以&quot;自然天成&quot;为最高追求——崇尚行云流水、反对雕琢造作、追求&quot;技进于道&quot;，并将艺术与旷达的人生境界完美统一。本章揭示苏轼崇尚自然、艺术与人生统一的艺术精神。</p>\n"}